imsd-plasma for Debian
======================

imsd-dialerd is started in the Plasma session in place of plasma-dialer's
modem daemon, which must not run at the same time. Upstream hides that
daemon's autostart entry for new accounts through /etc/skel; this package
doesn't install files in /etc/skel, so each account hides it once:

  mkdir -p ~/.config/autostart
  printf '[Desktop Entry]\nHidden=true\n' \
      > ~/.config/autostart/org.kde.modem.daemon.desktop

Then log out and back in.
